      "updated": 1793960128363,
      "created": 1793959467261,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Start Small\n    - the smallest system that solves the task\n2. Add planning\n    - when the sequence is genuinely dynamic\n3. Add memory\n    - when information must carry across sessions\n4. Add more agents\n    - when responsibilities divide clearly\n5. Add approvals and isolation\n    - when the agent can cause greater consequences\n6. Build evaluations\n    - to know if changes make it better or worse",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
